{"id":"af73296236e5df83","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md","title":"Turing Machine","display":"df-turing-machine — Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-turing-machine","aliases":["58-df-turing-machine","58-df-TM","58-df-zfc-comp-turing-machine","58-df-zfc-recursive-turing-machine"],"display":"df-turing-machine — Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-turing-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-turing-machine</span><span>58-df-TM</span><span>58-df-zfc-comp-turing-machine</span><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine — Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-integer.md\">../batch20/58-df-integer.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\">\\(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\)</span> 由 Assertion 中的存在量词绑定，不作为一元谓词的隐藏参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HaltState}\">\\(\\mathrm{HaltState}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HaltConf}\">\\(\\mathrm{HaltConf}\\)</span> 在下式定义；机器字母与状态用自然数编码，空白符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 为本书整数载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1,1\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(-1,1\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；与自然数之间采用本书指定的嵌入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land0\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\land q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land q_0\\neq q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\land q_0\\neq q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\land q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\delta:\\bigl((Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\\bigr)\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land0\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\land q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land q_0\\neq q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\land q_0\\neq q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\land q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\delta:\\bigl((Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\\bigr)\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HaltState}(M)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\omega:\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\in V\\;\n(M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\land q\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HaltState}(M)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\omega:\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\in V\\;\n(M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\land q\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Conf}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,h\\rangle:\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\in V\\;\n(&amp;M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land q\\in Q\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\land T\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\land|\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:T(k)\\neq0\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Conf}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,h\\rangle:\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\in V\\;\n(&amp;M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land q\\in Q\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\land T\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\land|\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:T(k)\\neq0\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HaltConf}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,h\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Conf}(M):q\\in\\mathrm{HaltState}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HaltConf}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,h\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Conf}(M):q\\in\\mathrm{HaltState}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原有七分量、双停机状态图灵机模型；补入所有结构分量的绑定与原来只在 Remark 中出现的格局、停机格局定义。</li>\n<li>自然数程序编号和预言机数值函数的独立编码见 <code>58-df-effective-program-coding</code>；此处不再通过未定义的“第 e 台机器”引入计算语义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>58-df-recursive — 递归函数</li>\n<li>58-df-primitive-recursive — 原始递归函数</li>\n<li>58-df-turing-reducible — Turing 归约</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-integer.md","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HaltState}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HaltConf}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"-1,1\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega\\land0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land|\\Sigma|<\\aleph_0\\land|\\Gamma|<\\aleph_0\\\\\n&\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land0\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\land q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in Q\\\\\n&\\land q_0\\neq q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\land q_0\\neq q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\land q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\\\\n&\\land\\delta:\\bigl((Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\\bigr)\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HaltState}(M)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\omega:\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\in V\\;\n(M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\land q\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Conf}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,h\\rangle:\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\in V\\;\n(&M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\\\\n&\\land q\\in Q\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\land T\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\land|\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:T(k)\\neq0\\}|<\\aleph_0)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HaltConf}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,h\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Conf}(M):q\\in\\mathrm{HaltState}(M)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2686,"backlinks":[{"id":"da8df6fd73c2eb5e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2803e07105244cf","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}_S$ (Turing-machine predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]])"},{"id":"f092de33576c5a12","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-turing-machine.md]])"},{"id":"7f65c348d236e554","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]] — Turing 机"},{"id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]] — Turing 机"},{"id":"48092f0b0